50:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Why all this hiding? You're home, and I know who you are.
51:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: You see, Iris, you know, but I don't want my people to recognize me. I have to keep it a secret.
52:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: You're afraid that if others find out, they won't have mercy on you.
53:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: As always, brimming with confidence. Was it that hard for you at the royal court?
54:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I wasn't a fan of torture. You made me watch that poor man suffer. I couldn't bear it anymore. 
55:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Soon everyone will know that supernatural phenomena and creatures have no place here.
56:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: You won't defeat him with golems.
57:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: I see you've seen through me.
58:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: The army you're building in the middle of the ocean won't help you at all.
60:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: There's just one small snag.
61:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: You mean the defender of KamStar. I'll warn you, he recently lost his artifacts. 
62:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: I know that. But he'll get them back soon anyway. The other one's days are numbered. His preparation is poor. Not like mine, I've been preparing for years.
63:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: But later, King Dyron will bother me a bit; I need something more.
64:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: The second gauntlet.
65:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: That's it. Where is it?
66:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Where did you find the first one?
67:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: In his tomb? Honestly, I was hoping I'd find a gauntlet of destruction there, not creation. 
68:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Before his death, Truth ordered the one you killed to create a tomb surrounded by a labyrinth.
69:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: I know, I was there.
70:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: But you don't know that a second labyrinth was built, much more difficult to traverse. He took a weapon safe for the government to the tomb.
71:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: He hid the second one so that no one could get it. A weapon so dangerous, so unpredictable, because only a true creator can wield destruction. Possessing them both makes you invincible... Theoretically. 
72:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: The second labyrinth is impenetrable; anyone who entered it never returned alive.
73:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: A living creature might not be enough.
74:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Living... A clever approach. Golem... I'll send a golem there.
75:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: When I hold both gauntlets. No king, no ruler will stop me from achieving my goal.
76:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: And here I must disappoint you.
77:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Why? Even with his armor, Dyron is defenseless against me. 
78:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I'm not talking about Dyron. The one who's coming, the one you want to stop, is more powerful than all.
79:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: I'll defeat him too. Even if I have to sacrifice an entire planet in the process.
80:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: He can't be defeated. He doesn't need any artifacts. He's above us all. No one can compare to his power, no creator, no ruler, not even legendary ones.
81:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: You think you can scare me with that.
82:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Crossbowmen!
83:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Remember, I warned you.
84:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Aim!
85:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Shoot!
86:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I've put on local clothes. I'll be able to pass through the city undetected.